{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":1,"id":"function-tablefeatures","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Function: tableFeatures()"}]},{"type":"code","value":"function tableFeatures<TFeatures>(features): TFeatures;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/helpers/tableFeatures.ts#L46","children":[{"type":"text","value":"helpers/tableFeatures.ts:46"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A helper function to help define the features that are to be imported and applied to a table instance.\nUse this utility to make it easier to have the correct type inference for the features that are being imported.\n"},{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Note:"}]},{"type":"text","value":" It is recommended to use this utility statically outside of a component."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Alongside feature modules, this object carries everything else that is\nstatically stitched into the table:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Row model factories ("},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"sortedRowModel"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"filteredRowModel"},{"type":"text","value":", etc.)"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Row model function registries ("},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"sortFns"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"filterFns"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"aggregationFns"},{"type":"text","value":"),\nwhose keys become the valid string values for "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"sortFn"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"filterFn"},{"type":"text","value":",\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"globalFilterFn"},{"type":"text","value":", and "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"aggregationFn"},{"type":"text","value":" with full inference"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type-only "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"tableMeta"},{"type":"text","value":"/"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"columnMeta"},{"type":"text","value":" slots for declaring per-table meta types\ninstead of using global declaration merging. The values are phantom\n(ignored and stripped at runtime); only their types are used."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tfeatures","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TFeatures"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFeatures"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/TableFeatures.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TableFeatures"}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"features","children":[{"type":"text","value":"features"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFeatures"},{"type":"text","value":" & "},{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/ValidateFeatureSlots.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ValidateFeatureSlots"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFeatures"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFeatures"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import {\n  columnFilteringFeature,\n  createFilteredRowModel,\n  createSortedRowModel,\n  filterFn_includesString,\n  rowSortingFeature,\n  sortFn_alphanumeric,\n  sortFn_text,\n  tableFeatures,\n} from '@tanstack/react-table'\nconst features = tableFeatures({\n  columnFilteringFeature,\n  rowSortingFeature,\n  filteredRowModel: createFilteredRowModel(),\n  sortedRowModel: createSortedRowModel(),\n  filterFns: { includesString: filterFn_includesString, myCustomFilterFn },\n  sortFns: { alphanumeric: sortFn_alphanumeric, text: sortFn_text },\n  tableMeta: {} as { updateData: (rowIndex: number, columnId: string, value: unknown) => void },\n  columnMeta: {} as { align?: 'left' | 'right' },\n});\nconst table = useTable({ features, columns, data });"}],"headings":[{"id":"function-tablefeatures","text":"Function: tableFeatures()","level":1},{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tfeatures","text":"TFeatures","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"features","text":"features","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n# Function: tableFeatures()\n\n```ts\nfunction tableFeatures<TFeatures>(features): TFeatures;\n```\n\nDefined in: [helpers/tableFeatures.ts:46](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/helpers/tableFeatures.ts#L46)\n\nA helper function to help define the features that are to be imported and applied to a table instance.\nUse this utility to make it easier to have the correct type inference for the features that are being imported.\n**Note:** It is recommended to use this utility statically outside of a component.\n\nAlongside feature modules, this object carries everything else that is\nstatically stitched into the table:\n\n- Row model factories (`sortedRowModel`, `filteredRowModel`, etc.)\n- Row model function registries (`sortFns`, `filterFns`, `aggregationFns`),\n  whose keys become the valid string values for `sortFn`, `filterFn`,\n  `globalFilterFn`, and `aggregationFn` with full inference\n- Type-only `tableMeta`/`columnMeta` slots for declaring per-table meta types\n  instead of using global declaration merging. The values are phantom\n  (ignored and stripped at runtime); only their types are used.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFeatures\n\n`TFeatures` *extends* [`TableFeatures`](../interfaces/TableFeatures.md)\n\n## Parameters\n\n### features\n\n`TFeatures` & [`ValidateFeatureSlots`](../type-aliases/ValidateFeatureSlots.md)\\<`TFeatures`\\>\n\n## Returns\n\n`TFeatures`\n\n## Example\n\n```\nimport {\n  columnFilteringFeature,\n  createFilteredRowModel,\n  createSortedRowModel,\n  filterFn_includesString,\n  rowSortingFeature,\n  sortFn_alphanumeric,\n  sortFn_text,\n  tableFeatures,\n} from '@tanstack/react-table'\nconst features = tableFeatures({\n  columnFilteringFeature,\n  rowSortingFeature,\n  filteredRowModel: createFilteredRowModel(),\n  sortedRowModel: createSortedRowModel(),\n  filterFns: { includesString: filterFn_includesString, myCustomFilterFn },\n  sortFns: { alphanumeric: sortFn_alphanumeric, text: sortFn_text },\n  tableMeta: {} as { updateData: (rowIndex: number, columnId: string, value: unknown) => void },\n  columnMeta: {} as { align?: 'left' | 'right' },\n});\nconst table = useTable({ features, columns, data });\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: tableFeatures\ntitle: tableFeatures\n---\n\n# Function: tableFeatures()\n\n```ts\nfunction tableFeatures<TFeatures>(features): TFeatures;\n```\n\nDefined in: [helpers/tableFeatures.ts:46](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/helpers/tableFeatures.ts#L46)\n\nA helper function to help define the features that are to be imported and applied to a table instance.\nUse this utility to make it easier to have the correct type inference for the features that are being imported.\n**Note:** It is recommended to use this utility statically outside of a component.\n\nAlongside feature modules, this object carries everything else that is\nstatically stitched into the table:\n\n- Row model factories (`sortedRowModel`, `filteredRowModel`, etc.)\n- Row model function registries (`sortFns`, `filterFns`, `aggregationFns`),\n  whose keys become the valid string values for `sortFn`, `filterFn`,\n  `globalFilterFn`, and `aggregationFn` with full inference\n- Type-only `tableMeta`/`columnMeta` slots for declaring per-table meta types\n  instead of using global declaration merging. The values are phantom\n  (ignored and stripped at runtime); only their types are used.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFeatures\n\n`TFeatures` *extends* [`TableFeatures`](../interfaces/TableFeatures.md)\n\n## Parameters\n\n### features\n\n`TFeatures` & [`ValidateFeatureSlots`](../type-aliases/ValidateFeatureSlots.md)\\<`TFeatures`\\>\n\n## Returns\n\n`TFeatures`\n\n## Example\n\n```\nimport {\n  columnFilteringFeature,\n  createFilteredRowModel,\n  createSortedRowModel,\n  filterFn_includesString,\n  rowSortingFeature,\n  sortFn_alphanumeric,\n  sortFn_text,\n  tableFeatures,\n} from '@tanstack/react-table'\nconst features = tableFeatures({\n  columnFilteringFeature,\n  rowSortingFeature,\n  filteredRowModel: createFilteredRowModel(),\n  sortedRowModel: createSortedRowModel(),\n  filterFns: { includesString: filterFn_includesString, myCustomFilterFn },\n  sortFns: { alphanumeric: sortFn_alphanumeric, text: sortFn_text },\n  tableMeta: {} as { updateData: (rowIndex: number, columnId: string, value: unknown) => void },\n  columnMeta: {} as { align?: 'left' | 'right' },\n});\nconst table = useTable({ features, columns, data });\n```\n"}
